{"4264310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh, Bubba Lu! Live from the Apocalypse!", "steam_appid": 4264310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/701111d7c6a0d3005854b5fe3bd9adbd.avif?t=1770169485\" width=720 height=144 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/80897f7e759bb053bb50228b4cf0abe7.poster.avif?t=1770169485\" width=108 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/80897f7e759bb053bb50228b4cf0abe7.webm?t=1770169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/6e1f66f572439a7dc19fdafa9ffba194.avif?t=1770169485\" width=432 height=122 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/4744ea8f4fda880f0632a354c374f74a.poster.avif?t=1770169485\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/4744ea8f4fda880f0632a354c374f74a.webm?t=1770169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/6bed96f4ae4225b859b93bd7aedb6aec.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bubba and Grumples are reporters. Armed with only their cell phones to take pictures, they are on the scene of large disasters to capture the story. But due to their cell phone addiction, they arrive at each scene with limited power. Choose your shots carefully - each picture has consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/8aed2a95c185e803eebfc81d2c1540a6.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your phone to save the day. Take pictures of clues to report what happened. Take photos of monsters to stun them. Take selfies to heal yourself. Take a photo of your ko’d friend to revive them. And always remember to photobomb your friends' photos for some extra health. Then write a story to expose the truth, or make up a crazier story to get lots of likes and money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/2b1f9b8b2167f021b728483ef32b38a4.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the photos you took to write your story. Take lots of monster pics for an action packed story. Take photos of clues to discover the truth as to why the apocalypse is happening. If that seems too hard, just make something up. The photos you take open up the story you can write. The story you write will determine the amount of money you receive to upgrade your camera, or how much the public trusts you. Each location brings new stories to write about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/05265923369dd8f58fabce9c54a9e8a2.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Report from monster uprisings in Chinatown, Koreatown, Little Tokyo, the abandoned zoo, Solvang, San Onofre and Catalina Island with diverse monsters in each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/c8c730762904fd075bb8433111812d76.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each  apocalypse brings its own kind of monster.  Battle against jiāngshīs, chupacabras, banshees, draugars, dokkaebi and many more. Each is a puzzle to be figured out and a beauty needed to be photographed.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/701111d7c6a0d3005854b5fe3bd9adbd.avif?t=1770169485\" width=720 height=144 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/80897f7e759bb053bb50228b4cf0abe7.poster.avif?t=1770169485\" width=108 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/80897f7e759bb053bb50228b4cf0abe7.webm?t=1770169485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/6e1f66f572439a7dc19fdafa9ffba194.avif?t=1770169485\" width=432 height=122 /></span