\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/2b1f9b8b2167f021b728483ef32b38a4.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the photos you took to write your story. Take lots of monster pics for an action packed story. Take photos of clues to discover the truth as to why the apocalypse is happening. If that seems too hard, just make something up. The photos you take open up the story you can write. The story you write will determine the amount of money you receive to upgrade your camera, or how much the public trusts you. Each location brings new stories to write about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/05265923369dd8f58fabce9c54a9e8a2.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Report from monster uprisings in Chinatown, Koreatown, Little Tokyo, the abandoned zoo, Solvang, San Onofre and Catalina Island with diverse monsters in each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264310/extras/c8c730762904fd075bb8433111812d76.avif?t=1770169485\" width=750 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each  apocalypse brings its own kind of monster.  Battle against jiāngshīs, chupacabras, banshees, draugars, dokkaebi and many more. Each is a puzzle to be figured out and a beauty needed to be photographed.</p>", "short_description": "The end is dangerously near and you're on the scene, armed with only your cell phone. Stun enemies with your flash, heal yourself with a selfie, or take photos of clues.